    atlasN: 1226,
    slug: "falsifiable-early-warning-science",
    title: { zh: "可证伪的临界预警科学", en: "Falsifiable Early-Warning Science" },
    qfocus: { zh: "当一个地球系统分量只有一条时间序列时，临界预警信号的预报技巧该如何被样本外检验与证伪？", en: "When an Earth-system component leaves only a single time series, how can the forecast skill of an early-warning signal be tested out of sample and falsified at all?" },
    domain: "数理",
    cluster: { code: "C49", zh: "计算可持续·韧性科学", en: "Computational Sustainability · Resilience Science" },
    scores: [4, 4, 3, 3, 5, 5, 4, 4, 4],
    citation: {
      url: "https://doi.org/10.1038/s41558-025-02328-8",
      title: "Ambiguity of early warning signals for climate tipping points",
      venue: "Nature Climate Change",
      year: 2025,
    },
    brief: { zh: "把临界慢化从事后叙事改造成预测协议：预注册预警判据，在合成与真实序列上算样本外技巧与假阳性率，用贝叶斯先验校正“观测到信号”到“临界将至”的跳跃，并把结果汇进社区基准库与假阳性排行榜。", en: "Convert critical slowing down from post-hoc narrative into a predictive protocol: preregister the warning criterion, compute out-of-sample skill and false-alarm rates on synthetic and real series, use Bayesian priors to correct the leap from \"a signal was observed\" to \"a tipping point is near,\" and pool results into a community benchmark suite and false-alarm leaderboard." },
    literature: [
      { title: "Uncertainties too large to predict tipping times of major Earth system components from historical data", venue: "Science Advances", year: 2024, url: "https://doi.org/10.1126/sciadv.adl4841" },
      { title: "Tipping point detection and early warnings in climate, ecological, and human systems", venue: "Earth System Dynamics", year: 2024, url: "https://esd.copernicus.org/articles/15/1117/2024/" },
    ],
    depth: {
      overview: { zh: "方差与一阶自相关上升长期被当作系统逼近临界点的通用预警。2024 年 Ben-Yami 等在 Science Advances 指出，从历史数据外推 AMOC 等分量的临界时间，不确定性大到无法可靠预测；2025 年 Rietkerk 等在 Nature Climate Change 又论证同一预警信号可能来自并非临界点的过程。问题于是从“有没有信号”转向“信号能否被证伪”。", en: "Rising variance and lag-one autocorrelation have long served as a universal warning that a system is approaching a tipping point. In 2024 Ben-Yami et al. showed in Science Advances that extrapolating tipping times for components such as the AMOC from historical data carries uncertainty too large for reliable prediction; in 2025 Rietkerk et al. argued in Nature Climate Change that the same signal can arise from processes that are not tipping at all. The question shifts from whether a signal exists to whether it can be falsified." },
      whyMatters: { zh: "预警一旦被采信就要触发昂贵甚至不可逆的干预；但多数研究只报告命中不报告假阳性，而“观测到 EWS”到“临界点将至”之间隔着一个先验，跳过它就是贝叶斯陷阱。", en: "A warning that is believed triggers expensive and sometimes irreversible intervention. Yet most studies report hits without false alarms, and a prior stands between \"an early-warning signal was observed\" and \"a tipping point is near\" — skipping it is a Bayesian trap." },
      ifAnswered: { zh: "临界预警可以像天气预报一样被逐年评分：每个预警方法都带着样本外技巧与假阳性率上榜，政策才敢按它下注，而不是靠一次事后复盘。", en: "Tipping-point warnings could be scored year on year like weather forecasts, each method entering the leaderboard with its out-of-sample skill and false-alarm rate — the condition under which policy can act on one rather than review it afterwards." },
      approaches: [
        { zh: "在已知结局的合成分岔序列上做预注册的样本外技巧检验，先固定判据再看数据。", en: "Run preregistered out-of-sample skill tests on synthetic bifurcation series with known outcomes, fixing the criterion before the data are seen." },
        { zh: "为每个预警方法计算假阳性率，把中性、非临界的过程当作必测对照。", en: "Compute a false-alarm rate for every warning method, making neutral non-tipping processes a mandatory control." },
        { zh: "用贝叶斯先验显式校正从“观测到信号”到“临界将至”的推断跳跃。", en: "Correct the inferential leap from observed signal to imminent tipping explicitly with a Bayesian prior." },
      ],
      barrier: { zh: "地球系统的每个分量在历史上往往只留下一条时间序列，样本外验证在原则上就无处可做；靠合成序列补齐，又会把对预警的检验偷换成对模拟器的检验。", en: "Each Earth-system component usually leaves only one historical time series, so out-of-sample validation has nowhere to happen in principle. Filling the gap with synthetic series quietly substitutes a test of the simulator for a test of the warning." },
      subQuestions: [
        { zh: "在只有单条实测序列的情形下，什么样的替代样本（同类系统、古气候记录）能合法充当样本外集？", en: "With a single measured series available, which surrogates — analogous systems, palaeoclimate records — can legitimately serve as an out-of-sample set?" },
        { zh: "预警信号的多义性能否被参数化，从而给出“这次上升有多大概率不是临界慢化”的量值？", en: "Can the ambiguity of an early-warning signal be parameterized to yield a number for how probable it is that a given rise is not critical slowing down?" },
        { zh: "社区基准库应怎样定义假阳性，才能让不同系统的预警方法在同一把尺子上排名？", en: "How should a community benchmark define a false alarm so that warning methods for different systems can be ranked on one scale?" },
      ],
    },
