    brief: { zh: "用混合整数规划与对偶界为 OPF 神经代理算最坏违约与最优性差证书，把验证结果回灌成训练约束形成训练—验证—修复闭环，并让验证域按实际运行包络而非人为超立方体来划。", en: "Certify worst-case violation and optimality gap for OPF neural proxies with mixed-integer programming and dual bounds, feed the verification result back as a training constraint to close a train-verify-repair loop, and draw the verification domain from the actual operating envelope rather than an arbitrary hyperrectangle." },
